  "core_text": "小王啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？小王站，我旁边不怕把你照老了站您旁边哪会显老，只会显得我年纪轻轻站的挺对我，真不怎么喜欢你。但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。但这人脾气挺好，没见你发过火，发火，解决不了问题，您在前面顶着压力，我在后面添乱不合适。年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。哎呀，我都老了，不中用了。哎，领导，您可千万别这么说，我们论能力、论经验论、资历多，不如这样的老前辈还得靠您带着我们进步啊。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住，秘密都吃到这个点儿了。你怎么还没敬我一杯敬您的人排着队呢？我最后一个敬前面的酒，您喝的是场面，我这杯您喝的是收尾，代表今天的事儿圆满啊。你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯啊，你怎么就喝这点儿养鱼呢？我得留着量，万一您喝到位了，总得有个清醒的人负责掏您家门钥匙吧。爸爸，哈哈好来好，今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教。不是哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你这敬酒的顺序是不是不对？怎么先敬别人，先把流程走完，最后踏踏实实，坐下来，陪您，慢慢喝好的，留到最后。哈哈哈哈哈哈打这么多饭，你喂猪呢，领导，我哪敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。哈哈哈哈，怎么菜还没上齐，你就结账了，先结账是表明态度。这顿饭我请定了，后面再加菜，您随便点，没有心理负担，吃了才尽兴。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心耳多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。哈哈哈哈哈哈这鱼怎么点的这么赞。前面大鱼大肉最后来一口清淡的漱漱口，就像您听完汇报最后来一句总结，清清爽爽，散会，好好啊啊，鱼是好鱼，可惜就是次多领导。您看虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹，是没有刺的这酒开了，你不先给我倒，先到的是客，后到的是主。您是今天的主人，最后一杯满上代表压轴，全桌的福气都沉淀在您杯底。小王啊，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您，你今天话怎么这么少？再听您说，酒桌上，您讲东西比开会时还有料，我舍不得打断你。怎么我来迟了，你也不打个电话催催催您是给您压力，等您是给您尊重您来迟肯定有原因。我等的就是信任到了，就是圆满来就来带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。哎呀，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。家里没什么好茶，你就凑合喝吧，茶叶好不好？得看怎么标价，您亲手倒的这杯，只讲情分，不讲价，和你这么漂亮的女孩吃饭不用喝就已经醉了。领导，您真幽默，您还没沾酒，就让我沾光了。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满，美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子没满，就是一辈子没满啊。好好好好好，怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了，怎么你一来我茶杯盖就摔碎了，碎碎平安盖碎了一地，平安铺满一地。您今天出门步步都会差了。我看你这丫头最近是越来越精神了啊，那是因为沾了领导，您的光跟着您干事儿，气色当然不会差了。小王啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。你这衣服穿了好几年了吧，穿着舒服，跟您共事久了，人也实在了不讲究那些虚的字，我字儿写的一般，你别为了哄我乱夸字，我确实不懂，但你一握笔，全屋都安静了，这我懂小李最近表现不错啊。我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思，领导也要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯礼，我就先收下了。但事儿能不能办成，我可不敢打包票啊。领导，您说笑了，这事儿能成是您的加持，不能成的话就是我的造化，无论结果如何，都得感谢。领导您的提携啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝那些会说话会来事的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交。推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我一解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 830,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1510,
      "end_ms": 3390,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3390,
      "end_ms": 4470,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4670,
      "end_ms": 8270,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 10830,
      "text": "小王站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10830,
      "end_ms": 14710,
      "text": "我旁边不怕把你照老了站您旁边哪会显老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15010,
      "end_ms": 19210,
      "text": "只会显得我年纪轻轻站的挺对我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19210,
      "end_ms": 20510,
      "text": "真不怎么喜欢你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21230,
      "end_ms": 23270,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23270,
      "end_ms": 25470,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28030,
      "end_ms": 29605,
      "text": "但这人脾气挺好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30160,
      "end_ms": 31200,
      "text": "没见你发过火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31660,
      "end_ms": 32060,
      "text": "发火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32060,
      "end_ms": 33000,
      "text": "解决不了问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33460,
      "end_ms": 34740,
      "text": "您在前面顶着压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34740,
      "end_ms": 36300,
      "text": "我在后面添乱不合适。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38119,
      "end_ms": 39220,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39820,
      "end_ms": 41560,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41860,
      "end_ms": 43000,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43120,
      "end_ms": 44260,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46240,
      "end_ms": 46660,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46980,
      "end_ms": 47860,
      "text": "我都老了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00023",
      "start_ms": 48060,
      "end_ms": 49000,
      "text": "不中用了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00024",
      "start_ms": 49140,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49440,
      "end_ms": 49800,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49800,
      "end_ms": 50840,
      "text": "您可千万别这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00027",
      "start_ms": 51020,
      "end_ms": 52780,
      "text": "我们论能力、论经验论、资历多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52780,
      "end_ms": 55320,
      "text": "不如这样的老前辈还得靠您带着我们进步啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00029",
      "start_ms": 55320,
      "end_ms": 57620,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00030",
      "start_ms": 57660,
      "end_ms": 59615,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00031",
      "start_ms": 61240,
      "end_ms": 61740,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00032",
      "start_ms": 61740,
      "end_ms": 62300,
      "text": "才守得住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00033",
      "start_ms": 62300,
      "end_ms": 66120,
      "text": "秘密都吃到这个点儿了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00034",
      "start_ms": 66120,
      "end_ms": 68800,
      "text": "你怎么还没敬我一杯敬您的人排着队呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00035",
      "start_ms": 68800,
      "end_ms": 70120,
      "text": "我最后一个敬前面的酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00036",
      "start_ms": 70120,
      "end_ms": 70880,
      "text": "您喝的是场面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00037",
      "start_ms": 70880,
      "end_ms": 72000,
      "text": "我这杯您喝的是收尾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00038",
      "start_ms": 72020,
      "end_ms": 73960,
      "text": "代表今天的事儿圆满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00039",
      "start_ms": 75030,
      "end_ms": 76505,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00040",
      "start_ms": 76820,
      "end_ms": 77200,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77300,
      "end_ms": 78340,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00042",
      "start_ms": 78420,
      "end_ms": 79520,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00043",
      "start_ms": 79720,
      "end_ms": 81160,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00044",
      "start_ms": 81160,
      "end_ms": 81760,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00045",
      "start_ms": 81780,
      "end_ms": 84945,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00046",
      "start_ms": 85080,
      "end_ms": 87135,
      "text": "你怎么就喝这点儿养鱼呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00047",
      "start_ms": 87550,
      "end_ms": 88330,
      "text": "我得留着量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00048",
      "start_ms": 88450,
      "end_ms": 89470,
      "text": "万一您喝到位了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00049",
      "start_ms": 89470,
      "end_ms": 91685,
      "text": "总得有个清醒的人负责掏您家门钥匙吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00050",
      "start_ms": 92730,
      "end_ms": 93090,
      "text": "爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00051",
      "start_ms": 93110,
      "end_ms": 93885,
      "text": "哈哈好来好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00052",
      "start_ms": 94970,
      "end_ms": 95990,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00053",
      "start_ms": 96010,
      "end_ms": 96475,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00054",
      "start_ms": 96810,
      "end_ms": 98210,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00055",
      "start_ms": 98210,
      "end_ms": 99155,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00056",
      "start_ms": 99460,
      "end_ms": 101140,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00057",
      "start_ms": 101140,
      "end_ms": 103365,
      "text": "不是哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00058",
      "start_ms": 103920,
      "end_ms": 105795,
      "text": "你这敬酒的顺序是不是不对？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00059",
      "start_ms": 106110,
      "end_ms": 106990,
      "text": "怎么先敬别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00060",
      "start_ms": 107130,
      "end_ms": 108110,
      "text": "先把流程走完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00061",
      "start_ms": 108250,
      "end_ms": 109110,
      "text": "最后踏踏实实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00062",
      "start_ms": 109110,
      "end_ms": 109490,
      "text": "坐下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00063",
      "start_ms": 109490,
      "end_ms": 109730,
      "text": "陪您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00064",
      "start_ms": 109730,
      "end_ms": 110630,
      "text": "慢慢喝好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00065",
      "start_ms": 110630,
      "end_ms": 111185,
      "text": "留到最后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00066",
      "start_ms": 112300,
      "end_ms": 114750,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00067",
      "start_ms": 114870,
      "end_ms": 115570,
      "text": "你喂猪呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00068",
      "start_ms": 115850,
      "end_ms": 116230,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00069",
      "start_ms": 116310,
      "end_ms": 117070,
      "text": "我哪敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00070",
      "start_ms": 117210,
      "end_ms": 119215,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00071",
      "start_ms": 119450,
      "end_ms": 120930,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00072",
      "start_ms": 121130,
      "end_ms": 122475,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00073",
      "start_ms": 122820,
      "end_ms": 123750,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00074",
      "start_ms": 124000,
      "end_ms": 125180,
      "text": "怎么菜还没上齐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00075",
      "start_ms": 125180,
      "end_ms": 125995,
      "text": "你就结账了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00076",
      "start_ms": 126460,
      "end_ms": 127935,
      "text": "先结账是表明态度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00077",
      "start_ms": 128150,
      "end_ms": 129135,
      "text": "这顿饭我请定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00078",
      "start_ms": 129390,
      "end_ms": 130130,
      "text": "后面再加菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00079",
      "start_ms": 130130,
      "end_ms": 130790,
      "text": "您随便点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00080",
      "start_ms": 130930,
      "end_ms": 131790,
      "text": "没有心理负担，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00081",
      "start_ms": 131790,
      "end_ms": 132575,
      "text": "吃了才尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00082",
      "start_ms": 133870,
      "end_ms": 135215,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00083",
      "start_ms": 135890,
      "end_ms": 137065,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00084",
      "start_ms": 137670,
      "end_ms": 139350,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心耳多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00085",
      "start_ms": 139350,
      "end_ms": 140595,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00086",
      "start_ms": 141750,
      "end_ms": 144590,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈这鱼怎么点的这么赞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00087",
      "start_ms": 144650,
      "end_ms": 147095,
      "text": "前面大鱼大肉最后来一口清淡的漱漱口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00088",
      "start_ms": 147360,
      "end_ms": 149460,
      "text": "就像您听完汇报最后来一句总结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00089",
      "start_ms": 149600,
      "end_ms": 150180,
      "text": "清清爽爽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00090",
      "start_ms": 150180,
      "end_ms": 150665,
      "text": "散会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00091",
      "start_ms": 151060,
      "end_ms": 151930,
      "text": "好好啊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00092",
      "start_ms": 152040,
      "end_ms": 153005,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00093",
      "start_ms": 153550,
      "end_ms": 155710,
      "text": "可惜就是次多领导。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00094",
      "start_ms": 155710,
      "end_ms": 156830,
      "text": "您看虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00095",
      "start_ms": 156830,
      "end_ms": 158530,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00096",
      "start_ms": 158530,
      "end_ms": 162360,
      "text": "是没有刺的这酒开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00097",
      "start_ms": 162480,
      "end_ms": 163455,
      "text": "你不先给我倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00098",
      "start_ms": 163980,
      "end_ms": 164720,
      "text": "先到的是客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00099",
      "start_ms": 164720,
      "end_ms": 165440,
      "text": "后到的是主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00100",
      "start_ms": 165500,
      "end_ms": 166440,
      "text": "您是今天的主人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00101",
      "start_ms": 166440,
      "end_ms": 167860,
      "text": "最后一杯满上代表压轴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00102",
      "start_ms": 167940,
      "end_ms": 169755,
      "text": "全桌的福气都沉淀在您杯底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00103",
      "start_ms": 171240,
      "end_ms": 171985,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00104",
      "start_ms": 172300,
      "end_ms": 173825,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00105",
      "start_ms": 174320,
      "end_ms": 176000,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00106",
      "start_ms": 176000,
      "end_ms": 178220,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00107",
      "start_ms": 178300,
      "end_ms": 179055,
      "text": "我先敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00108",
      "start_ms": 180610,
      "end_ms": 181850,
      "text": "你今天话怎么这么少？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00109",
      "start_ms": 182070,
      "end_ms": 182770,
      "text": "再听您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00110",
      "start_ms": 183030,
      "end_ms": 183490,
      "text": "酒桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00111",
      "start_ms": 183490,
      "end_ms": 185305,
      "text": "您讲东西比开会时还有料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00112",
      "start_ms": 185500,
      "end_ms": 186525,
      "text": "我舍不得打断你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00113",
      "start_ms": 188840,
      "end_ms": 189905,
      "text": "怎么我来迟了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00114",
      "start_ms": 190230,
      "end_ms": 192770,
      "text": "你也不打个电话催催催您是给您压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00115",
      "start_ms": 192850,
      "end_ms": 195035,
      "text": "等您是给您尊重您来迟肯定有原因。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00116",
      "start_ms": 195310,
      "end_ms": 196650,
      "text": "我等的就是信任到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00117",
      "start_ms": 196650,
      "end_ms": 200090,
      "text": "就是圆满来就来带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00118",
      "start_ms": 200110,
      "end_ms": 200985,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00119",
      "start_ms": 201260,
      "end_ms": 201660,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00120",
      "start_ms": 201760,
      "end_ms": 202300,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00121",
      "start_ms": 202300,
      "end_ms": 202960,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00122",
      "start_ms": 203080,
      "end_ms": 204445,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00123",
      "start_ms": 204730,
      "end_ms": 207165,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00124",
      "start_ms": 208340,
      "end_ms": 209500,
      "text": "家里没什么好茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00125",
      "start_ms": 209740,
      "end_ms": 210805,
      "text": "你就凑合喝吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00126",
      "start_ms": 211190,
      "end_ms": 212090,
      "text": "茶叶好不好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00127",
      "start_ms": 212170,
      "end_ms": 213155,
      "text": "得看怎么标价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00128",
      "start_ms": 213530,
      "end_ms": 214630,
      "text": "您亲手倒的这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00129",
      "start_ms": 214810,
      "end_ms": 215490,
      "text": "只讲情分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00130",
      "start_ms": 215490,
      "end_ms": 216055,
      "text": "不讲价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00131",
      "start_ms": 216330,
      "end_ms": 220085,
      "text": "和你这么漂亮的女孩吃饭不用喝就已经醉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00132",
      "start_ms": 220360,
      "end_ms": 220775,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00133",
      "start_ms": 221080,
      "end_ms": 221875,
      "text": "您真幽默，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00134",
      "start_ms": 222180,
      "end_ms": 223020,
      "text": "您还没沾酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00135",
      "start_ms": 223020,
      "end_ms": 223995,
      "text": "就让我沾光了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00136",
      "start_ms": 224320,
      "end_ms": 225960,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00137",
      "start_ms": 226330,
      "end_ms": 226665,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00138",
      "start_ms": 227260,
      "end_ms": 228165,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00139",
      "start_ms": 228510,
      "end_ms": 229810,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00140",
      "start_ms": 230030,
      "end_ms": 231130,
      "text": "领导美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00141",
      "start_ms": 231130,
      "end_ms": 231510,
      "text": "美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00142",
      "start_ms": 231610,
      "end_ms": 232575,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00143",
      "start_ms": 232800,
      "end_ms": 233680,
      "text": "这一辈子没满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00144",
      "start_ms": 233680,
      "end_ms": 234845,
      "text": "就是一辈子没满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00145",
      "start_ms": 235140,
      "end_ms": 236195,
      "text": "好好好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00146",
      "start_ms": 236500,
      "end_ms": 237605,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00147",
      "start_ms": 237970,
      "end_ms": 239475,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00148",
      "start_ms": 240390,
      "end_ms": 241390,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00149",
      "start_ms": 241450,
      "end_ms": 242930,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00150",
      "start_ms": 243070,
      "end_ms": 244850,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00151",
      "start_ms": 246390,
      "end_ms": 248730,
      "text": "怎么你一来我茶杯盖就摔碎了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00152",
      "start_ms": 249210,
      "end_ms": 251170,
      "text": "碎碎平安盖碎了一地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00153",
      "start_ms": 251170,
      "end_ms": 252330,
      "text": "平安铺满一地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00154",
      "start_ms": 252410,
      "end_ms": 254470,
      "text": "您今天出门步步都会差了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00155",
      "start_ms": 256270,
      "end_ms": 259990,
      "text": "我看你这丫头最近是越来越精神了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00156",
      "start_ms": 260330,
      "end_ms": 261370,
      "text": "那是因为沾了领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00157",
      "start_ms": 261370,
      "end_ms": 262930,
      "text": "您的光跟着您干事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00158",
      "start_ms": 262930,
      "end_ms": 264110,
      "text": "气色当然不会差了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00159",
      "start_ms": 266090,
      "end_ms": 266750,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00160",
      "start_ms": 267550,
      "end_ms": 269565,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00161",
      "start_ms": 270610,
      "end_ms": 272690,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00162",
      "start_ms": 272770,
      "end_ms": 274550,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00163",
      "start_ms": 275890,
      "end_ms": 277890,
      "text": "你这衣服穿了好几年了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00164",
      "start_ms": 278910,
      "end_ms": 279750,
      "text": "穿着舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00165",
      "start_ms": 280110,
      "end_ms": 281070,
      "text": "跟您共事久了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00166",
      "start_ms": 281070,
      "end_ms": 285850,
      "text": "人也实在了不讲究那些虚的字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00167",
      "start_ms": 285850,
      "end_ms": 286870,
      "text": "我字儿写的一般，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00168",
      "start_ms": 287290,
      "end_ms": 289290,
      "text": "你别为了哄我乱夸字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00169",
      "start_ms": 289330,
      "end_ms": 290090,
      "text": "我确实不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00170",
      "start_ms": 290370,
      "end_ms": 291250,
      "text": "但你一握笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00171",
      "start_ms": 291250,
      "end_ms": 292190,
      "text": "全屋都安静了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00172",
      "start_ms": 292250,
      "end_ms": 296715,
      "text": "这我懂小李最近表现不错啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00173",
      "start_ms": 297090,
      "end_ms": 299090,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00174",
      "start_ms": 299090,
      "end_ms": 300110,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00175",
      "start_ms": 300290,
      "end_ms": 301010,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00176",
      "start_ms": 301050,
      "end_ms": 302270,
      "text": "领导也要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00177",
      "start_ms": 302270,
      "end_ms": 305470,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00178",
      "start_ms": 305470,
      "end_ms": 306410,
      "text": "我就先收下了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00179",
      "start_ms": 306470,
      "end_ms": 307570,
      "text": "但事儿能不能办成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00180",
      "start_ms": 307570,
      "end_ms": 308730,
      "text": "我可不敢打包票啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00181",
      "start_ms": 308730,
      "end_ms": 308950,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00182",
      "start_ms": 308950,
      "end_ms": 309670,
      "text": "您说笑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00183",
      "start_ms": 309770,
      "end_ms": 311090,
      "text": "这事儿能成是您的加持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00184",
      "start_ms": 311090,
      "end_ms": 312350,
      "text": "不能成的话就是我的造化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00185",
      "start_ms": 312370,
      "end_ms": 313130,
      "text": "无论结果如何，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00186",
      "start_ms": 313130,
      "end_ms": 313690,
      "text": "都得感谢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00187",
      "start_ms": 313690,
      "end_ms": 314690,
      "text": "领导您的提携啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00188",
      "start_ms": 315470,
      "end_ms": 317090,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00189",
      "start_ms": 317290,
      "end_ms": 318290,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00190",
      "start_ms": 318530,
      "end_ms": 320690,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00191",
      "start_ms": 320890,
      "end_ms": 324390,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝那些会说话会来事的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00192",
      "start_ms": 324390,
      "end_ms": 325690,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00193",
      "start_ms": 325690,
      "end_ms": 326685,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00194",
      "start_ms": 326960,
      "end_ms": 327680,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00195",
      "start_ms": 327780,
      "end_ms": 328920,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00196",
      "start_ms": 329240,
      "end_ms": 331200,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00197",
      "start_ms": 331500,
      "end_ms": 333720,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00198",
      "start_ms": 334020,
      "end_ms": 335260,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00199",
      "start_ms": 335380,
      "end_ms": 336760,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00200",
      "start_ms": 336980,
      "end_ms": 339660,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00201",
      "start_ms": 339800,
      "end_ms": 341200,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00202",
      "start_ms": 341220,
      "end_ms": 342080,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00203",
      "start_ms": 342340,
      "end_ms": 342520,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00204",
      "start_ms": 342520,
      "end_ms": 344600,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00205",
      "start_ms": 344760,
      "end_ms": 345440,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00206",
      "start_ms": 345920,
      "end_ms": 346940,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00207",
      "start_ms": 347000,
      "end_ms": 348320,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00208",
      "start_ms": 348660,
      "end_ms": 350340,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00209",
      "start_ms": 350420,
      "end_ms": 352140,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00210",
      "start_ms": 352360,
      "end_ms": 353340,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00211",
      "start_ms": 353460,
      "end_ms": 356360,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00212",
      "start_ms": 356360,
      "end_ms": 357850,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00213",
      "start_ms": 358050,
      "end_ms": 359285,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00214",
      "start_ms": 359600,
      "end_ms": 360940,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00215",
      "start_ms": 361220,
      "end_ms": 362665,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00216",
      "start_ms": 362920,
      "end_ms": 364260,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00217",
      "start_ms": 364320,
      "end_ms": 366165,
      "text": "这个真是让我一解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00218",
      "start_ms": 366450,
      "end_ms": 367715,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00219",
      "start_ms": 368000,
      "end_ms": 371180,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00220",
      "start_ms": 371460,
      "end_ms": 374125,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00221",
      "start_ms": 374360,
      "end_ms": 375785,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00222",
      "start_ms": 376110,
      "end_ms": 377495,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00223",
      "start_ms": 377780,
      "end_ms": 380125,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00224",
      "start_ms": 380470,
      "end_ms": 381530,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00225",
      "start_ms": 381790,
      "end_ms": 384185,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_919ec11f532d97b9_s00226",
      "start_ms": 384540,
      "end_ms": 386255,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
